          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omumbuga zanyu zoona, otemu abacwi b'emisango n'abalemi, MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe ezi arukwija kukuha, abarukwingana enganda zanyu; bacwerege abantu emisango ey'obwinganiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
